OL,3,GNEWSAWe spent thousands on a Tui river
OL,4,Acruise but ended up on coach trips
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers who paid thousands of pounds
OL,7,Ffor European river cruises with Tui
OL,8,Fhave described their anger after their
OL,9,Fitineraries changed to involve hours
OL,10,Fspent on coach trips instead.
OL,12,FSeveral have told the BBC they believe
OL,13,Fthey should get some money back, but
OL,14,Fhave been offered no refund.
OL,16,FTui apologised and blamed low water
OL,17,Flevels on the Danube, adding that
OL,18,Fcustomers continued their holidays on
OL,19,Famended itineraries under its standard
OL,20,Fbooking conditions.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
